WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.400
Hello. I'm Aimee Lou Wood.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.120
I am Chinenye Ezeudu.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.400
I'm George
from Sex Education.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.920
And I'm going to help you
relax and let go

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.640
with some calming words
and music.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.080
First of all,
make yourself comfortable,

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.440
and allow yourself to settle
into the space around you.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.200
Prepare your body
to change gears,

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.920
like Otis and Eric

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.280
when they're riding
down the hill to school,

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:32.080
except much slower.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.560
Take a deep breath in…

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:36.760
and then out.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.120
When you're ready,

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.960
close your eyes
if you want to,

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.240
and picture
the entrance of Moordale.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.440
As you wait
outside the school,

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:54.120
collect your energy
and scan your body.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:58.240
Think about your head
and your beautiful brain,

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.080
and then just start
to feel the awareness

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.400
flow from the top
of your head

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.920
all the way down your body,

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:09.280
like a relaxing liquid
or a fluid.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.360
Because everything
is fluid, isn't it?

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.400
Gender, sexuality…

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:17.200
icing sugar.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:21.120
Feel it flowing
through your arms,

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:25.080
which will take longer
if they're unusually long,

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:26.640
like Otis Milburn.

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:30.240
And then,
right down to your feet

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:32.920
and the tip of your toes.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.320
Take another deep breath

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.160
and begin to walk
towards the school entrance,

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:42.160
passing the wall
of Van Groff art

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.000
and the demolished toilets.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:47.800
Walk slowly
towards the doors,

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:50.280
feeling the wind
on your face

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.600
and the smell of fresh paint

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:54.960
from a newly-graffitied
yoni.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.640
As you open the doors,

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.120
you're greeted
by a sweetly smell.

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.400
This time,
it's freshly baked cupcakes,

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:05.040
courtesy of Aimee's Cakes.

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:07.920
Soft, warm and spongy.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:10.800
Take in another deep breath

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:12.960
and check in with your body.

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.120
Are you tense anywhere?

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:19.960
If yes, offer that part
of your body, a cupcake,

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.320
placing that warmth there,

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.040
softening it with the cake.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.320
As we move
further down the hall

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.000
towards the outside area,

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.320
take another deep breath

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:34.160
and scan your body,

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:37.120
focussing on
those parts of you

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.200
that feel a little stressed.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.800
And like Otis and Eric,

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.800
or a good best friend would,

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.080
spend a moment there,

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.880
extending kind
and friendly awareness

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.360
towards that part
of your body,

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.640
without judgement.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.680
Your body
is your best friend,

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.840
the Aimee to your Maeve.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:00.000
Even if you're not
totally sure

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:01.800
why they adopted a goat,

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.920
allow that vision of Goat

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.480
to proceed
as you look outside.

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:10.000
And imagine it off its lead,

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.520
running around
the school grounds,

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:15.680
wise, free, fearless.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.000
You're all of those things.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:19.880
You're the goat.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.600
So offer yourself
gratitude for that,

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.720
for getting yourself
through the hallway

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.160
and through this day.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.800
When you're ready,
open your eyes

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.120
and come back
to wherever you are,

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.960
remembering your wisdom

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.960
and that it's OK to let go.

